{"title":"Elder Basilisk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 36 Basilisk that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (3.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 5× XP and 5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>87</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>55</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>25</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>87</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" d